  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The triggerman is separated from other lovers of momentum by the use of moxie, a certain swagger that only comes from following the path of the dakka. Some triggermen, yourself included, put particular focus in your moxie.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Moxie pool class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a moxie talent for which you meet all the prerequisites.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Moxie Training multiple times. Each time, you gain an additional moxie talent for which you meet all the prerequisites.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
